{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "1ad108835bd964c4a8c492292f44e41339442e40dad1129d5a3cdc7d1ca6cad4", "ja": "天使たちの裏方仕事", "zh": "天使们的幕后工作", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b8e26f68d1ee3e3fa7ac18440e32a8636a1eece48b59049c519c5151bbdd826b", "ja": "公演のポスター貼りの帰り道、プロデューサ\nー達は1人でチラシを配る風花を見つける。\n少しでもチームの役に立ちたいと、陰ながら\n頑張る風花の姿に、代表という立場にプレッ\nシャーを感じていた杏奈は、勇気をもらう。", "zh": "张贴完公演海报后，制作人等人遇上单独发着\n传单的风花。看见风花想尽可能为分队贡献\n心力而默默努力的模样，曾因自己被选为代表\n而颇有压力的杏奈也重拾了勇气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b421ec6d18d44dce095e50958e12c17b3b60396282b2d8e9434cd64e02aab514", "ja": "（今日は、ANGEL STARSの公演ポスターを\n貼るために、みんなと町にやってきた）", "zh": "（今天为了张贴『ANGEL STARS』的公演海报，\n和大家一起来到街上。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1001_p", "source_sha256": "9d238e430fd6cf2d82e16236d68fcac8b8729463182282e8ea90778cf0b93ef0", "ja": "ポスターはたくさん作ったし。\n張り切って貼ろうな、みんな！", "zh": "都做了这么多海报，\n大家拿出干劲好好贴吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "3b399003e6ba803873789e26b343a74f4395b55c02d946ef3c77f410a26ecdd2", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\n全部……貼ったよ……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n全都……贴好了喔……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1003_p", "source_sha256": "5564c66519c89ce88c31cb776382136653674df8d3a74e314a30ebc454026602", "ja": "え！？\n杏奈、もう終わったのか？　全部？", "zh": "咦！？\n杏奈，你都贴完了？全部？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "0c706fb0e3de57909add7f3654480e0f9631d40968b574b2b9aea0d0e41e61ac", "ja": "えへへ……♪　よく行く、ゲームショップとか……\nゲームセンターに、お願い……したの……♪", "zh": "嘿嘿……♪杏奈去拜托……\n常去的游戏店……还有电玩中心了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "ea28461581423a23d8f8a6140b4f47eb79fad5934737bd230bbfde287d2fe9d7", "ja": "みんな……杏奈たち、観に来てくれるって……。\n……杏奈も……楽しみ……♪", "zh": "大家都说……会来看杏奈我们……\n……杏奈也……很期待……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1006_p", "source_sha256": "1d8eb977f1da1df45ad5437a8dabd3fb44259a4fe82d53f48779c1a7a5a44157", "ja": "そんなツテが……さすが杏奈だな。\n助かるよ！", "zh": "还有这招……不愧是杏奈呢。\n帮了大忙喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "da4f06a5521eb876c509079a7ab8fb38ed9bb08d5848049c16c6a364f69dc2a2", "ja": "私も、杏奈ちゃんに負けていられません～。知り合いの\nおじいちゃん達のところに、貼ってもらいますよ～。", "zh": "我也不能输给杏奈～\n我要去贴在认识的老爷爷们那边～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1008_p", "source_sha256": "03cbaf9fc8de5f8f8bf0ac106054a5ba3c085b3fb90e516677e4b332f1831c09", "ja": "知り合いのおじいちゃん達？\n美也、それは一体……。", "zh": "认识的老爷爷们？\n美也，那是指……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "ee811c732e4abb1a7986ea19ae8954d72b8c5d8c5ad5a5754df025fe67f1cfa9", "ja": "はい～。碁会所です～。", "zh": "是的～是围棋俱乐部～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "965f2a63fc1c0b4c462df23e0897c2cc11e1d85299b1d022408fa3b435924154", "ja": "そっか、みんな行きつけがあるんだね！\n私はどこにしようかな……？", "zh": "这样啊，大家都有常去的地方呢！\n那我该去哪里呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1011_p", "source_sha256": "4056aecbc2e3c46d9c42f956b0c4872dfb6dce463e1b1071b1703bca1e74003d", "ja": "いや、行きつけでなくていいから。今日はこの近くの\nお店にお願いしよう。もう半分くらいは貼ったしな。", "zh": "不，不是常去的地方也没关系，\n今天就来拜托这附近的店家吧，毕竟都贴完一半了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "d3915525603ace62949beaed8c05c98a51a2b79e3a24f2923862341f60908d1e", "ja": "でも、普通に貼るだけで、見てもらえるでしょうか～？\nもっと目立った方がいいかもしれません～。", "zh": "但照一般的贴法，大家会看吗～？\n也许弄得显眼一点会比较好～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "fa7f9f6e0847eb8a58af843e389eb3905bb0f617e0cf58139896c293d871c60e", "ja": "あっ、じゃあ、逆さまに貼ってみようか？\nすごく気になっちゃうと思うな♪", "zh": "啊，那要不要倒着贴贴看？\n我想这样应该会很引人关注喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1014_p", "source_sha256": "86be2e299172fe1bb6057f567ce168826db5828beea9b9a565b165f6d42e3a22", "ja": "まさに逆転の発想だな！\nでも字が読みづらいから、やめておこう。", "zh": "真是逆向思考呢！\n但这样很难看懂上面的字，还是不要吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1015_042miy", "source_sha256": "b71d422ca45fb0a28641cb1ef6df3f684713664e5d996a4455862fb5fe46899c", "ja": "ポスターに風船をつけて、たくさん飛ばしたら、\n天使に見えないでしょうか～？", "zh": "如果在海报上装上气球，放很多张到天上，\n看起来会不会像天使呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1016_p", "source_sha256": "a1e045d0b49b724d0bc6e240b8e39ace6e0449f26406896dd9b9d599b7f4cdfc", "ja": "うーん、目立ちそうだけど、\n許可が取れるかどうか……", "zh": "嗯～虽然应该很醒目，\n但不知道能不能拿到许可……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "95edd9bc44b39d443988ba114a5a70372cffb4ab637660905f7b3ddcdfee3f3f", "ja": "じゃあじゃあ、私達がポスターを持って\nビューンと空を飛ぶのはどうですか？", "zh": "那就让我们拿着海报，\n咻地飞到天上如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1018_p", "source_sha256": "bcc4b3276af3da54f581806a31002d4924867f64f207ca3b222e71f3d3705b83", "ja": "うん、大問題になり過ぎると思う。", "zh": "嗯，我想应该会引发超大的问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1019_042miy", "source_sha256": "199e70626f72cb05d79d1692636c51606ec43d6d22f9ef4707238ff35d82f0c5", "ja": "む～ん……何か、たくさん人を呼べる、\nいいアイディアはないでしょうか～？", "zh": "唔～嗯……有没有什么\n能吸引人潮的好点子呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1020_042miy", "source_sha256": "9718f0083b507d9b24502e5363a01ce1d81fe2ccf099146caa66b04a78eedb68", "ja": "ANGEL STARSの新曲お披露目ですし、\nみんなに見てもらいたいのですが～。", "zh": "毕竟是『ANGEL STARS』的新歌首唱，\n真希望能让大家都来看看～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1021_048rei", "source_sha256": "7e67fef1c663c458a736e2d51b6b609655493a29cc4e6f1a4636d7eccab9771f", "ja": "うんうん、そうだね♪\nみんなで新曲歌うの、楽しみだね♪", "zh": "嗯嗯，对呀♪\n好期待跟大家一起唱新歌喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1022_024ann", "source_sha256": "ab8c72af8b1baf299d6d1e470867250d364bcc126e5c19d7f01fed566d1f4854", "ja": "新……曲……。", "zh": "新……歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1023_p", "source_sha256": "45e2393359d013210ec080b9c1920febd657859c4602dbd9ed4fbdc68741beec", "ja": "やっぱり、1件ずつお願いして貼っていこう。\n地道な宣伝活動も大切だからな。", "zh": "还是逐一拜托店家来张贴吧，\n脚踏实地的宣传活动也是很重要的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1024_048rei", "source_sha256": "5d5146d23fb1b5edbb73a8556bd45f16c7379a2511db867078e7a525b3e3c296", "ja": "{$P$}さん……その普通さ、\nとっても素敵です♪　ポスター貼り、頑張りますね♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生……这种平凡感\n真的很棒♪我会努力贴海报的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1025_042miy", "source_sha256": "d764507ebb2a889880a35202bba302cdb7e167bed095bb2ea3a0991e530a106e", "ja": "そうですね～。\nそれでは、あっちに行ってみましょう～。", "zh": "对呀～\n那就去那边看看吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1026_p", "source_sha256": "d64534282165b6860e7a3c91018a066114a09c7490d4dff5cbbe72460a84dc30", "ja": "（美也も麗花も、モチベーションが高いな！\n……ん？　杏奈？）", "zh": "（美也和丽花都很积极呢！\n嗯？杏奈？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1028_p", "source_sha256": "f2548d4ffe9048404f3da384893fd20666ff8677eda0a2fa8b7772245da308a3", "ja": "杏奈、どうした？", "zh": "杏奈，你怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1029_024ann", "source_sha256": "7be8fe7f41f6421ceb5eca747ce36478cf2773cd05df6a92d9161c8e537c62d2", "ja": "あ……{$P$}さん。\nえっと……。", "zh": "啊……{$P$}先生，\n那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1030_024ann", "source_sha256": "f660a2b8d223070d2cfdead6327671a916945d334ec7e5e29fd58578da3b5ec4", "ja": "あのね……杏奈、アイドル好きで……。\nずっと……ひとりで、歌ってたけど……。", "zh": "那个呀……杏奈喜欢偶像……\n以前一直是……一个人唱歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1031_024ann", "source_sha256": "1c2c4e5afd90e94388c2149901d89d2f4729e76fafd6e218959f1f3878be07f0", "ja": "今回は、Angel……みんなの、代表……。\n杏奈……ちゃんと、できるかなって……。", "zh": "这次被选为Angel……成员的代表……\n杏奈……不知道能不能做好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1032_p", "source_sha256": "c539d07fd54ba93b8a4992aa5e5b1de746fc1e8a843a459c1027977ac3b354a3", "ja": "杏奈……。", "zh": "杏奈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1033_p", "source_sha256": "a6946b65917fc60e6aa94f76a2e78d58f2dea8c91fea4f42e663b71956c685a8", "ja": "（Angelのメンバーは、全部で18人。……代表する\nのはプレッシャーだろうな。どう励まそうか……）", "zh": "（Angel的成员共有18人……\n要做为代表应该很有压力吧。该怎么鼓励她……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1034_042miy", "source_sha256": "b60d8e0b23418790153575930e91a09a0db28a64eb266dcff4901914cfac7d35", "ja": "ただいまです～。お預かりした分は、全部貼って\nもらえましたよ～。そろそろ、劇場に戻りませんか～？", "zh": "我回来了～交给我的份全都拜托店家张贴了～\n我们差不多该回剧场了吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1035_p", "source_sha256": "3802e16aab08409291d9db18e6e01a069eaf8453db00898a7591117df2079d74", "ja": "美也……ああ、そうだな。\nそれじゃみんな、先に劇場に戻ってくれ。", "zh": "美也……嗯，是啊。\n那你们就先回剧场吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1036_024ann", "source_sha256": "734cc76c6594b000d1cc6f7ec3ef8ad0920caef7d99ba017a1ac54b3f29cdc45", "ja": "え……。{$P$}さんは……？", "zh": "咦……{$P$}先生呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1037_p", "source_sha256": "487198fa90c5ad6de2c5775464d2245c7339e0d15ed96dda136376c4740df630", "ja": "俺はこの後、風花とチラシ配りなんだ。\n大丈夫、いっぱい配るから任しといてくれ！", "zh": "我接下来要和风花去发传单。\n别担心，我们会大发特发的，交给我们吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1038_024ann", "source_sha256": "387f5660005dcc0422bb391e7147c631078b007e63c474fe3ad93606bdaa3f47", "ja": "いっぱい……。", "zh": "大发特发……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1039_048rei", "source_sha256": "26301f63633130e9d1422fa88fb67297c0e8aaa161c308b4813a74e159cd2172", "ja": "ずるいですよ、{$P$}さん！\nそんな楽しそうなこと、ひとり占め～なんてなんて♪", "zh": "太狡猾了，{$P$}先生！\n一个人独享那么好玩的事～这可不行♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1040_p", "source_sha256": "b77c7d3a4a273e5bfdf857b1e81985f664b7791b6cc1d383247cf1ae7f908ebb", "ja": "いや、風花と二人だからひとり占めじゃない……\nというか、ずるいって何だ？", "zh": "不，我是和风花一起发，所以不算独享……\n话说这哪里狡猾了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1041_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6a3acb75402a2c7b3146ccfeed4c1a3be7cf109e5a4f1de621ac7dcc19914a3e", "ja": "よろしくお願いしま～すっ！　765プロライブ劇場、\n次回ANGEL STARS公演でーす！　新曲やりまーす！", "zh": "请参考看看～！765艺能演唱会剧场接下来要办\n『ANGEL STARS』公演──！我们会演唱新歌──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1042_041fuk", "source_sha256": "db6cec9f45b35d96c294a39fac5a76099a3e1fe7ca89063c80f98a3f148fb8c0", "ja": "あっ、こちら、よかったらお願いします♪\nアイドルのライブなんです！", "zh": "啊，这边，方便的话请看看♪\n是偶像演唱会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1043_tukou", "source_sha256": "afe5eea623e0363bf4fec9e70498a39ba01f8819990f0b049cae6db6e8f492b4", "ja": "アイドルのライブ？\nこれって、お姉さんも出演するの？", "zh": "偶像演唱会？\n小姐你也会上台表演吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1044_041fuk", "source_sha256": "04294a1286959909148e3f4e48e351702c287a465a2b03530a772b9362116a26", "ja": "はい♪　新曲のオープニングナンバーを歌うのは、\nANGEL STARSの代表なんですけど……。", "zh": "是的♪虽然开场演唱新歌的是\n『ANGEL STARS』的代表……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1045_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ab0d14df12f2b5f631bff73145d93170375c47fd363f1575b032ace0d568f072", "ja": "チーム全員で、最高のステージを\n作り上げる予定です！　是非お越しくださいね！", "zh": "整场演出会由分队的所有成员\n带来最精彩的表演！欢迎到场观赏！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1046_tukou", "source_sha256": "570c1ba1c5ad9c049fa729ab3636f22750df8aae07aeefdcd87cb639ca92c3b8", "ja": "そ、そう、お姉さんもなんだ。\nすごい……！", "zh": "是、是喔，小姐你也会表演啊。\n好厉害……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1047_041fuk", "source_sha256": "053ae917d74137d85cafb57b43538c038903213c9d82ce789e40cda6cd61cbc8", "ja": "はい？", "zh": "怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1048_tukou", "source_sha256": "d43518520d846ec92b77d8d014b4aecdca77264c99d3dc8fc4714f4e8f1cba6b", "ja": "あ、いえ、行かせてもらいます！\nあの、チラシありがとう！", "zh": "啊，没事，我会去的！\n那个，谢谢你的传单！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1049_041fuk", "source_sha256": "bac47a6604607b3eb3489b04309aa576ec7015680b119ee625af5038067339f5", "ja": "ありがとうございました～！\nふう……。", "zh": "非常感谢～！\n呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1050_p", "source_sha256": "c6e116fd5b495ea0197b50a25a7cc10a401ab66a40329496a5f24897caf5b410", "ja": "……ふう、じゃないぞ、風花！", "zh": "……你在「呼」什么啊，风花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1051_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6f5e42d7d0a913b4b8d5359d0ec961e2ff9acd6c07c3b67f548b2fad3c1e9c59", "ja": "きゃっ！　……あっ、{$P$}さん！？", "zh": "呀啊……啊，{$P$}先生！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1052_p", "source_sha256": "874182063a154d8b6322bb5c5aaf13c897fa1553920014c7a1b4fed199057d8d", "ja": "合流してからって言っただろう。アイドルが1人で\nチラシ配りなんて……、危ないだろう！", "zh": "我说过要集合后再开始吧？\n身为偶像居然一个人发传单……很危险耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1053_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8eaea89f0029bf88202205e6c2ab9ff7e28243f316ee3196d77b135244f77800", "ja": "す、すみませんっ！　私、ただ待っているだけなのが\nもったいなくて、つい……。", "zh": "对、对不起！\n我觉得光在这里等很可惜，不小心就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1054_041fuk", "source_sha256": "dd53ff7599ffad99d636252280cdb6585944e2524f091545ebdab9a2fde8b343", "ja": "それに、みんなが公演に向けて頑張ってるのに、\n私、ほとんどお仕事で手伝えなかったから……。", "zh": "而且大家为了公演努力时，\n我几乎都在工作，帮不上忙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1055_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1bfbc69abeb0619b9d0940101ebe6b1fb906618f045ea78f56d6ef99fc771007", "ja": "グラビアのお仕事で、手伝えなかったから……。", "zh": "因为拍写真集的工作而无法帮忙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1056_p", "source_sha256": "bda889ed367d6dca79efe2f9379c6e5215d372fd0620594641056c5fa14d74a5", "ja": "……あ、いや、Angel公演の発表以来、\nオファーがすごくて……いい仕事なんだぞ？", "zh": "……啊，不会的，在发表Angel公演消息后\n来了好多工作邀约……是很棒的工作机会喔？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1057_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3fe574e9bdd34a626ab716560075119ef22fad41e4a254f1aed510d42387a90a", "ja": "だから、せめてチラシは、いっぱい配らなくちゃって。\nそれで……怒られるとは思ったんですけど……。", "zh": "所以我才想说至少要多发点传单，\n虽然有想过……可能会因为这样而被骂……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1058_p", "source_sha256": "fa4cdf93b085229d06e6e239bb465aeabcbce836a3d93d9c9d43690911bfb37c", "ja": "やれやれ。気持ちはありがたいけど、\nちゃんとルールは守ること。いいな？", "zh": "真是的，我很感谢你的心意，\n但要好好遵守规则，知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1059_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a2c8df994dfab829f5203ad6554197f2c3623c524657767cd5575f02b0fee477", "ja": "はい……。", "zh": "好的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1060_p", "source_sha256": "728a7734107f0fe14baf54f728aab1da2502eacca7381fe25dc320a194b78325", "ja": "それにチラシなら、たくさん配れそうだから大丈夫。\n人手が増えちゃったから。", "zh": "而且看来我们可以发出很多传单，别担心。\n因为人手增加了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1061_041fuk", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1062_048rei", "source_sha256": "f80239f860a1587774754243acba3178c31f3d18095db9e23a5461b8cd2f65b6", "ja": "じゃじゃ～ん♪　風花さん、来ちゃった～♪", "zh": "锵锵～♪风花，我们来啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1063_042miy", "source_sha256": "8cba25c6c9d0db59a1c35e16789167a703063f4fdb510fa73bca2247a7eb7cd9", "ja": "私達も、お手伝いさせてくださいね～。", "zh": "请让我们一起帮忙～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1065_041fuk", "source_sha256": "664fa1fd7d5e7c044a811ee3394e6481695a788f9fb9b924b89be36f2d629a13", "ja": "麗花ちゃん、美也ちゃん、\nそれに杏奈ちゃんまで！？", "zh": "丽花、美也，\n连杏奈都来了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1066_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a14fbb56fd66259ae31370a2e49a2d5151d86cbe2a5c4865bc064d679cffed72", "ja": "みんな、{$P$}さんと一緒に\nポスターを貼った後なのよね？　疲れてないの？", "zh": "大家是和{$P$}先生一起\n贴完海报才来的吧？不会累吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1067_042miy", "source_sha256": "3baa8370356c70ad8a20c4186657f00a9fe08245a0cb5b481ab76a0c4b8b26bc", "ja": "風花さんも、たくさんのお仕事の合間ですよね？\nおんなじですよ～。", "zh": "风花姊也是利用繁忙工作之间的空档吧？\n我们是一样的喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1068_048rei", "source_sha256": "c3a150f1bcf4976dca88a16129902f997363d7d7ca9d923bc94d327d83f675ae", "ja": "よく言うじゃないですか！\n1人より4人、2人より100人です♪", "zh": "大家不是常这样说吗～\n1人比不上4人、2人比不上100人♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1069_p", "source_sha256": "878211117c594f2428a6df36b6407437c4094ff8ab72f55486b60ab135a7b1c6", "ja": "（100人？）", "zh": "（100人？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1070_024ann", "source_sha256": "9e2218e2f10fb29dc11d1187d588968c00ee1281dc9ee084b065c2c03939edca", "ja": "風花さん……。あのね……。\n杏奈も、頑張りたい……です。", "zh": "风花姊……那个呀……\n杏奈也想……好好努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1071_024ann", "source_sha256": "a543a341eafcb33ef8328adec109b9e20e0682e60da74d88147abbfec687977c", "ja": "ちゃんとできるか、心配……。\nだけど、杏奈も、風花さんみたいに……。", "zh": "虽然很担心能不能做好……\n但是，杏奈也想像风花姊一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1072_024ann", "source_sha256": "124dae88f2231ab8fb11426bd3e6f3dc006a4d07a7f1ba9175a7915fad9d5078", "ja": "{$P$}さんに、怒られるくらい……。\nチームのために、できること……したい……です。", "zh": "想为分队……贡献自己……的力量，\n到会被{$P$}先生骂的程度……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_04_1073_041fuk", "source_sha256": "909b26eab6af5d15c3f4bbcd047aa0bf9b9e39474704cb610a9079691fe0a36b", "ja": "杏奈ちゃん……。", "zh": "杏奈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
